            "review_title": "Review at Bay Buffet Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mike J\nChepstow, United Kingdom860 contributions\n2\nSea food heaven!\nApr 2023\nThis is a very popular with locals place to eat and very good value for money. You basically can eat as much seafood and Asian dishes as you want for a set price. We loved the way they did the prawns and could not stop eating them! There is plenty of every kind of seafood you could think of and some which was foreign to us. It is a very family type restaurant and expect to see lots of kids running around making lots of noise.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 29, 2023",
