            "review_title": "Review at Bay Buffet Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Keith T\nStillwater, Oklahoma199 contributions\n0\nElaborate Vietnamese Buffet\nJun 2018 • Friends\nI was the guest of several Vietnamese friends recently who took me to dinner here. The restaurant is dominated by the various buffet areas and two cooking areas where a very large variety of food is available. There are many types of seafood in addition to chicken, pork, beef, etc. The food all appeared fresh and properly served, and the restaurant was clean. I enjoyed my meal and especially appreciated the large variety of foods that were available.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 10, 2018",
