            "review_text": "Taikaivietnam\nHanoi, Vietnam383 contributions\n0\nWell-decoration, warmly welcome\nJul 2017 • Family\nThe good point is: Bay on its own is a beautiful architecture ,not so big but well-decorated ,the indoor tree-style roof make you feel fantastic and comfortable.\nThe reception team is really, truly hospitable and enthusiastic .\nMy feeling is quite complicated the warmly welcome of the staff and the stylist decoration here has made a very good impression on me but in the other hand, the bad news is as a buffet restaurant there's a lot of dishes here from beef,lamb,shrimp, oyster, Salmon to salad, dessert... but none of them is good enough for attract me to come here for the second time.\nRead more\nWritten March 19, 2018",
