            "review_text": "ferdinando c\nNoventa Padovana, Italy65 contributions\n0\nIs it possible eat divinely in a nice place a cheap price ? Yes, in Vietnam you can do it\nDec 2017 • Friends\nIf you are travelling in Vietnam and you pass for Hanoi, you have to absolutely try this restaurant to buffet. It is on Cau Giay district , a buffet like this you can find it only on Hotel from 5 Stars on up.\n\nQuality is very good, very clean place and nice, you can eat how much you want and the price is very cheap for that you eat, when I seen the bill I remained very surprised. Try to believe.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 17, 2017",
